---
layout: base.njk
title: Skills & Tools — Abantika
---
<div class="page-shell">
{% include "components/header.njk" %}
<main class="inner-page skills-page">
  <section class="page-intro compact">
    <p class="eyebrow">06 / SKILLS & TOOLS</p>
    <h1>TOOLS FOR<br>ASKING BETTER<br>QUESTIONS<span class="red-stop">.</span></h1>
    <p>The working toolkit, grouped by the kinds of questions it helps answer. Groups are content-driven and can be updated without changing the page.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="skill-listing">
    {% for group in skills %}
    <div>
      <p>{{ group.number }}</p>
      <h2>{{ group.title }}</h2>
      <ul>
        {% for item in group.items %}
        <li>{{ item }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
</main>
{% include "components/footer.njk" %}
</div>
